1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,500
ReviewMaster collects product reviews
from your real orders.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,000
You approve them, and they appear
on your product pages.

3
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:14,000
This store has 27 published reviews.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,000
This is what a shopper sees
on the product page.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,000
A star summary, the rating breakdown,
and the reviews.

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:37,000
This badge only appears when the review
came from a real order.

7
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:41,500
Imported reviews never get it.

8
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Low ratings are published too —
nothing in the app hides them.

9
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:54,000
When an order is fulfilled, the app
schedules a review invitation.

10
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:03,000
The merchant chooses the timing — here,
14 days after fulfilment, with one reminder.

11
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:12,000
The customer gets this email.
One link, no account needed.

12
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:20,000
They rate it, write a line, and submit.

13
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:35,000
It lands in the app marked verified,
because it matched that order.

14
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:45,000
New reviews wait for approval.
Auto-publish is off by default.

15
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:50,000
One click publishes it.

16
00:01:53,000 --> 00:02:00,000
The merchant can reply in public.
The reply appears under the review.

17
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:09,000
Nine layouts. The preview updates
as you change anything.

18
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:17,000
Colours, layout, how many reviews show,
what each card shows.

19
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:23,000
And the mobile view.

20
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:31,000
One click puts the review block on your
product page. No theme code.

21
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:41,000
Reviews you already own can be imported —
CSV, manual entry, or an AliExpress listing.

22
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:49,000
Amazon and eBay are excluded on purpose:
those reviews describe a different seller.

23
00:02:49,500 --> 00:02:54,000
Imported reviews are never marked as verified.

24
00:02:56,000 --> 00:03:02,000
Shoppers ask questions on the product page.
You answer, and it publishes there.

25
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:12,000
A discount in exchange for a review — 10% for
text, 15% with a photo, 20% with video.

26
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:20,000
Every incentivised review carries a disclosure,
and the discount is issued whatever the rating.

27
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:29,000
This feed sends your star ratings
to Google Shopping.

28
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:37,000
Free, Growth and Scale. Merchants change
plan here through Shopify billing.

29
00:03:37,500 --> 00:03:42,000
The change takes effect immediately.
